caption: Hybrids and Derived Species
species-rule: hybrids-and-derived-species

Hybrid Species generally do not exist. Lycanthropy and Vampirism are Supernatural Modifications rather than hybrids; cybernetics do not change Species; uplifts are unique Species; and Changelings are their own Species.
